# Splash screen is locked

The Home Screen loading screen is working. Do **not** edit it while changing the rest of the app.

Do not touch unless the user explicitly asks to change the splash / schermata di caricamento / apple-touch-startup-image:

- `public/boot-paint.css`
- `src/lib/splash.ts`, `src/lib/critical-paint.ts`, `src/lib/apple-startup.ts`
- `src/components/splash/**`
- splash markup in `src/app/layout.tsx` (`#vibeup-boot-splash`)
- `public/splash/**`, `public/vibeup-splash-logo-112.png`

App CSS (`globals.css`, Tailwind, layout chrome) must **never** target `#vibeup-boot-splash` or `.vibeup-splash*`.

Never:

- Swap the logo `div` for `<img>` (`img { height: auto }` resizes it)
- Put the splash inside `AppProviders`
- Skip the HTML splash in standalone / PWA (`navigator.standalone`)
- Add a second React splash overlay (`SplashScreen` must return `null`)
- Change logo size away from `128px` or the position `50% - 12vh - 64px`
- Add a media-less `apple-touch-startup-image` fallback
